  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "The two big aerospace contractors said to be involved in recovering crashed unexplained craft are, according to a helicopter pilot named Jake Barber, exactly the two companies anyone would guess first. Barber, who says he took part in such retrievals himself, says it in a 2025 conversation with Jesse Michels and the researcher known as UAPGerb: \"if you took two guesses, you'd get both of them right on the first try.\" If true, it would mean the country's best-known defence builders hold this hardware, though Barber never names them."
